{"id":"29c30973fd2ffd89","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-superstability.md","title":"Superstability in a Countable Language","display":"df-superstability — Superstability in a Countable Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"numbering_status":"local atom identifier; not the book result number","source_section":"7.1","source_result":"7.1.30 and terminology following it","source_pages_print":"504–505","source_pages_djvu":"520–521","source_verification":"OCR checked for the stated source and scope; mathematical translation reviewed","type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-superstability","aliases":["17-df-superstability"],"display":"df-superstability — Superstability in a Countable Language","depends_on":["[[17-df-theory-properties]]","[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","[[17-df-stability-spectrum]]","[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-df-8.1.4b"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"numbering_status","html":"local atom identifier; not the book result number"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"7.1.30 and terminology following it"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"504–505"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"520–521"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"OCR checked for the stated source and scope; mathematical translation reviewed"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-superstability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-superstability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-superstability — Superstability in a Countable Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e6a4ebf476ad2f6d\" href=\"?note=e6a4ebf476ad2f6d\" title=\"17-df-stability-spectrum\">17-df-stability-spectrum</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-8.1.4b"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a> 的基数谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是可数语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的完全理论；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Complete}\">\\(\\operatorname{Complete}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|L|\">\\(|L|\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Stable}_\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{Stable}_\\kappa\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e6a4ebf476ad2f6d\" href=\"?note=e6a4ebf476ad2f6d\" title=\"17-df-stability-spectrum\">17-df-stability-spectrum</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为无限基数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{\\aleph_0}\">\\(2^{\\aleph_0}\\)</span> 为基数幂。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Superstable}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Superstable}_L\\)</span> 在此定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Superstable}_L(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\\land|L|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\forall\\kappa\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land2^{\\aleph_0}&lt;\\kappa\\to\\operatorname{Stable}_\\kappa(T)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Superstable}_L(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\\land|L|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\forall\\kappa\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land2^{\\aleph_0}&lt;\\kappa\\to\\operatorname{Stable}_\\kappa(T)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §7.1.30–32 限定可数语言，superstable 是在每个大于连续统的基数上稳定。旧阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{|\\operatorname{Sym}(L)|}\">\\(2^{|\\operatorname{Sym}(L)|}\\)</span> 会在有限语言中错误地要求有限基数稳定，从而排除无限纯等词理论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-theory-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-language-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"e8f9375543fc2e7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-stability-spectrum","status":"resolved","id":"e6a4ebf476ad2f6d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depen